{"sections":[{"slug":"对称幺半范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"对称幺半范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"对称幺半范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴是</span> $(\\mathsf{Cat},\\times)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/交换代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">交换代数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">也可等价地定义为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/E∞-空间","text":"$\\mathbb E_\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathsf{CAlg}(\\mathsf{Ani})$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴对象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">严格化</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴的严格化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">严格化</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3>PROP</h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">有一类对称幺半范畴范畴常作为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数理论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">语法范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> <strong></strong>"},{"Local":{"url":"/PROP","text":"PROP"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">意为</span> products &amp; permutations), <span lang=\"zh\">它是指所有对象均形如</span> $x^{\\otimes n}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对称幺半范畴</span>.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Lawvere理论","text":"Lawvere <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是</span> PROP <span lang=\"zh\">的特殊情形</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">它的运算</span> $\\otimes$ <span lang=\"zh\">是范畴论</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/积(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">积</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>PROP <span lang=\"zh\">又可视为单色</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":": <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> PROP $\\mathcal P$, $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P}(x^{\\otimes n},x)$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成一个单色算畴的</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">元运算</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/积幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">积幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半</span> ∞-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}